            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naye akaondoka, akaenda; mara akamwona mtu wa Kushi, towashi, mwenye mamlaka chini ya Kandake malkia wa Kushi, aliyesimamia hazina yake yote; naye alikuwa amekwenda Yerusalemu kuabudu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
